        costImpact: "$650 (Nozzles Misting & Failing to Reach Target Throw Distance)",
        description: "Pressure vacuum breakers and RPZ assemblies consume 5 to 12 PSI of dynamic water pressure just pushing past the internal check springs and relief valves.",
        solution: "Deduct 10 PSI from your static street pressure when calculating available working nozzle pressure at the end of the longest lateral pipe run."
      },
